                "markdown": "## Elevation of Privilege Threats\n\nReview IAM least-privilege policies, Sybil resistance mechanisms, route authorization, and SSRF protections.\n\n**References**: OWASP A01 (Broken Access Control), CWE-269 (Improper Privilege Management)"
              },
