          "message": {
            "text": "WAF managed rule bypass via payload encoding may allow an attacker exploiting rule engine edge cases to evade WAF inspection and reach the origin with malicious payloads.",
            "markdown": "Enable AWS WAF full logging on critical rules; subscribe to AWS Managed Rules notifications; implement rate-based rules as defense-in-depth; periodically conduct WAF bypass penetration tests."
