          "message": {
            "text": "API Gateway route exploitation via unexpected paths or HTTP methods may trigger undefined Lambda behavior or expose error details enabling further reconnaissance.",
            "markdown": "Ensure all API Gateway routes explicitly return 404 for undefined paths; configure a catch-all route returning 403; review Lambda dispatcher for unexpected route error handling."
