            "markdown": "Implement WAF rate-based rule on POST /vote keyed to source IP (max N requests per 5-minute window); add WAF Bot Control managed rule set; consider CAPTCHA; implement server-side per-IP vote anomaly alerting; evaluate per-pollID vote caps."
