          "message": {
            "text": "Frontend asset injection via compromised CI/CD credentials may allow an attacker to replace or inject malicious JavaScript into the S3 bucket, serving malicious code to all users loading the frontend.",
            "markdown": "Rotate CI/CD IAM credentials regularly; use IAM roles with OIDC federation instead of long-lived keys; enable S3 MFA Delete; implement deployment pipeline approval gates; integrate S3 PutObject events into security alerting with hash verification."
