            "text": "Systematic ballot-stuffing via concurrent multi-identity vote submission may allow an attacker automating POST /vote with distinct UUIDs to inflate vote counts for a preferred option — each request passes all validation and records a legitimate vote, enabling controlled poll result manipulation.",
            "markdown": "Implement WAF rate-based rule on POST /vote keyed to source IP; add WAF Bot Control; evaluate CAPTCHA; implement server-side per-poll anomaly detection; consider requiring a signed challenge token for vote submission."
